只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"An OAuth adapter for DSH","id":"gh:1342932407","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-oauth-adapter","slug":"edge-sky/dsh-oauth-adapter","topics":["dsh-plugin","dsh-plugin-bundle","dsh-plugin-market","dsh-plugins"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"An OAuth adapter for DSH"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-oauth-adapter"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"An OAuth account page for the DSH Web profile. It supports:"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"| Provider | pi-ai sign-in path |"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"| OpenAI Codex | Browser callback or device code |\n| GitHub Copilot | GitHub or GitHub Enterprise de"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"vice code |\n| Anthropic | Browser callback with manual code/redirect fallback |\n| Kimi For Coding | "},{"id":"p6s3","text":"Device code |\n| OpenRouter | Browser PKCE callback |\n| xAI | Device code |"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"The current plugin declares DSH peer compatibility as `>=0.2.0-rc.2`, with no upper version limit. D"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"evelopment dependencies remain pinned to `0.2.0-rc.2` to verify the minimum supported version."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"For DSH `>=0.2.0-rc.2`:"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Or for the official desktop, use `@edge-sky/dsh-oauth-adapter`"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"For DSH `0.1.2-rc.1` through `0.1.5-rc.1`, use an adapter release from the `0.1.3` series. For DSH `"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"0.1.1-rc.2`, use `@edge-sky/dsh-oauth-adapter@0.1.2-rc.0`."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Start DSH:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"For models not explicitly listed as supported by the built-in pi-ai, you can add them manually (avai"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"lability needs to be verified on your own)."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"DSH integrates pi-ai through the `@deepseek-ai/dsh-llm-pi-ai` adapter, but does not provide an OAuth"},{"id":"p17s2","text":" entry point. `@edge-sky/dsh-oauth-adapter` exposes pi-ai's existing provider login flows through th"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"e DSH Authorization Service. Browser links, device codes, text and secret input, method selection, c"},{"id":"p17s4","text":"ancellation, and withdrawn prompts all use the same provider-neutral transport."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"The profile patch mounts an authorization fallback when the host does not provide `ctx.authorization"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"e profile patch mounts an authorization fallback when the host does not provide `ctx.authorization`."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"DSH owns OAuth credentials and login state. This adapter stores model configuration in `dsh-oauth-ad"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"apter.modelStore`; see model migration and recovery."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"If this plugins is has helped you, please give a star for me, or create issues if you have any sugge"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"s plugins is has helped you, please give a star for me, or create issues if you have any suggestion~"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
